/-!
# Axiom audit umbrella for the Duan--Wu--Zhou level-two tier

Imports the 257 focused `#assert_axioms` companions of the level-two tier of `[duan2023faster]`,
so that `lake build AxiomAudit.DuanWuZhouLevelTwo` re-checks the whole tier's axiom cone in one
target.  Like every module under `AxiomAudit/`, it is already a build root through the
`globs = ["AxiomAudit.*"]` entry of `lakefile.toml`; it declares nothing of its own and adds no
assertion beyond those of the modules it imports.

The library side is `AlgebraicComplexity/DuanWuZhouLevelTwo.lean`.

Primary source `[duan2023faster]`: Ran Duan, Hongxun Wu and Renfei Zhou, *Faster Matrix
Multiplication via Asymmetric Hashing*, arXiv:2210.10173, section 6.1 `sec:global-algo`,
`papers/sources/2210.10173/global_value.tex`.
-/
